{
  "name": "Shadow Courier — Tier 1: Liminal Operator",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "art/bbttcc/GOTTGAIT/BBTTCC%20Button%20Icons/BBTTCC_button_icon_dimensional_4.png",
  "system": {
    "category": "technique",
    "source": "Bad Eden Bulwark + Shadow Courier v1.0 (RFI-native rules)",
    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>You cross what isn't supposed to be crossed — and you always come out the other side carrying something.</em></p><p><strong>On gaining Shadow Courier Initiation 1 you receive:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Skill rank +1 in <strong>Stealth (Intrigue)</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Skill rank +1 in <strong>Tinkering (Intrigue)</strong>.</p></li><li><p><strong>Intrigue OP cap +2</strong> and <strong>Logistics OP cap +2</strong> on the faction your character belongs to.</p></li><li><p><strong>Pace</strong> pool comes online (movement-generated). Max = max(2, ceil((Intrigue value + Shadow Courier Initiation) / 3)), capped at 8. Refills on Soma Break and on Package delivery.</p></li><li><p><strong>Package</strong> slot comes online — one Package at a time, type set by your chosen Route at L1.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Pace generation.</strong> Gain 1 Pace when you move at least 6 squares on your turn. Maximum 1 Pace generated per turn from this feature. Doctrine features may add their own generators.</p><p><strong>Baseline Pace spends</strong> (free action, 1 Pace each):</p><ul><li><p>Move 5 extra feet without spending an action.</p></li><li><p>Reroll a single Stealth (Intrigue), Athletics (Violence), or Tinkering (Intrigue) check — keep the new result.</p></li><li><p>Ignore a single reaction strike against you on this turn.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Liminal Sense.</strong> Once per encounter, ignore the first detection-style roll an opponent attempts against you (perception, scrying, Insight to read your intent, etc.). The roll is treated as if it had failed; resources spent on the attempt are not refunded.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
